{"source": "align_vo.py (wav2vec2-base-960h CTC)", "lines": [{"text": "AI can write a whole app before your coffee cools.", "start": 0.31, "end": 2.55, "words": [{"w": "AI", "start": 0.31, "end": 0.44}, {"w": "can", "start": 0.44, "end": 0.56}, {"w": "write", "start": 0.56, "end": 0.74}, {"w": "a", "start": 0.74, "end": 0.88}, {"w": "whole", "start": 0.88, "end": 1.08}, {"w": "app", "start": 1.26, "end": 1.46}, {"w": "before", "start": 1.46, "end": 1.78}, {"w": "your", "start": 1.78, "end": 1.92}, {"w": "coffee", "start": 1.92, "end": 2.32}, {"w": "cools.", "start": 2.32, "end": 2.55}]}, {"text": "But ask it for one diagram, and you get this.", "start": 3.14, "end": 6.0, "words": [{"w": "But", "start": 3.14, "end": 3.38}, {"w": "ask", "start": 3.38, "end": 3.55}, {"w": "it", "start": 3.55, "end": 3.69}, {"w": "for", "start": 3.69, "end": 4.04}, {"w": "one", "start": 4.04, "end": 4.26}, {"w": "diagram,", "start": 4.26, "end": 4.83}, {"w": "and", "start": 5.05, "end": 5.18}, {"w": "you", "start": 5.18, "end": 5.32}, {"w": "get", "start": 5.32, "end": 5.56}, {"w": "this.", "start": 5.56, "end": 6.0}]}, {"text": "Boxes everywhere. Arrows crossing arrows. Five colours shouting at once.", "start": 6.44, "end": 11.31, "words": [{"w": "Boxes", "start": 6.44, "end": 6.94}, {"w": "everywhere.", "start": 7.07, "end": 7.61}, {"w": "Arrows", "start": 8.12, "end": 8.58}, {"w": "crossing", "start": 8.58, "end": 9.06}, {"w": "arrows.", "start": 9.06, "end": 9.31}, {"w": "Five", "start": 9.78, "end": 10.16}, {"w": "colours", "start": 10.16, "end": 10.64}, {"w": "shouting", "start": 10.64, "end": 10.96}, {"w": "at", "start": 10.96, "end": 11.16}, {"w": "once.", "start": 11.16, "end": 11.31}]}, {"text": "Now watch the exact same diagram again.", "start": 11.93, "end": 13.96, "words": [{"w": "Now", "start": 11.93, "end": 12.16}, {"w": "watch", "start": 12.16, "end": 12.42}, {"w": "the", "start": 12.42, "end": 12.54}, {"w": "exact", "start": 12.54, "end": 13.02}, {"w": "same", "start": 13.02, "end": 13.26}, {"w": "diagram", "start": 13.26, "end": 13.72}, {"w": "again.", "start": 13.72, "end": 13.96}]}, {"text": "Same boxes, same facts. Except now it looks like a design studio made it.", "start": 14.5, "end": 18.76, "words": [{"w": "Same", "start": 14.5, "end": 14.82}, {"w": "boxes,", "start": 14.82, "end": 15.48}, {"w": "same", "start": 15.48, "end": 15.9}, {"w": "facts.", "start": 15.9, "end": 16.38}, {"w": "Except", "start": 16.77, "end": 17.1}, {"w": "now", "start": 17.1, "end": 17.3}, {"w": "it", "start": 17.3, "end": 17.36}, {"w": "looks", "start": 17.36, "end": 17.54}, {"w": "like", "start": 17.54, "end": 17.68}, {"w": "a", "start": 17.68, "end": 17.76}, {"w": "design", "start": 17.76, "end": 18.16}, {"w": "studio", "start": 18.16, "end": 18.44}, {"w": "made", "start": 18.44, "end": 18.56}, {"w": "it.", "start": 18.56, "end": 18.76}]}, {"text": "This is Diagram Design, a free, open-source skill for AI coding agents, with over 49,000 GitHub stars.", "start": 19.41, "end": 26.58, "words": [{"w": "This", "start": 19.41, "end": 19.7}, {"w": "is", "start": 19.7, "end": 19.88}, {"w": "Diagram", "start": 19.88, "end": 20.46}, {"w": "Design,", "start": 20.46, "end": 20.82}, {"w": "a", "start": 21.34, "end": 21.56}, {"w": "free,", "start": 21.56, "end": 21.94}, {"w": "open-source", "start": 21.94, "end": 22.58}, {"w": "skill", "start": 22.58, "end": 22.98}, {"w": "for", "start": 22.98, "end": 23.15}, {"w": "AI", "start": 23.15, "end": 23.5}, {"w": "coding", "start": 23.5, "end": 23.84}, {"w": "agents,", "start": 23.84, "end": 24.26}, {"w": "with", "start": 24.42, "end": 24.58}, {"w": "over", "start": 24.58, "end": 24.74}, {"w": "49,000", "start": 24.74, "end": 25.94}, {"w": "GitHub", "start": 25.94, "end": 26.2}, {"w": "stars.", "start": 26.2, "end": 26.58}]}, {"text": "And its trick is one every good designer knows, and almost no AI does.", "start": 27.24, "end": 31.36, "words": [{"w": "And", "start": 27.24, "end": 27.4}, {"w": "its", "start": 27.4, "end": 27.59}, {"w": "trick", "start": 27.59, "end": 27.85}, {"w": "is", "start": 27.85, "end": 28.08}, {"w": "one", "start": 28.08, "end": 28.19}, {"w": "every", "start": 28.32, "end": 28.64}, {"w": "good", "start": 28.64, "end": 28.82}, {"w": "designer", "start": 28.82, "end": 29.24}, {"w": "knows,", "start": 29.24, "end": 29.48}, {"w": "and", "start": 29.93, "end": 30.08}, {"w": "almost", "start": 30.08, "end": 30.46}, {"w": "no", "start": 30.46, "end": 30.73}, {"w": "AI", "start": 30.73, "end": 31.14}, {"w": "does.", "start": 31.14, "end": 31.36}]}, {"text": "Install it once, then just ask: draw an architecture diagram of my app.", "start": 31.97, "end": 36.05, "words": [{"w": "Install", "start": 31.97, "end": 32.4}, {"w": "it", "start": 32.4, "end": 32.58}, {"w": "once,", "start": 32.58, "end": 32.92}, {"w": "then", "start": 33.14, "end": 33.3}, {"w": "just", "start": 33.3, "end": 33.6}, {"w": "ask:", "start": 33.6, "end": 33.8}, {"w": "draw", "start": 34.22, "end": 34.48}, {"w": "an", "start": 34.48, "end": 34.6}, {"w": "architecture", "start": 34.6, "end": 35.18}, {"w": "diagram", "start": 35.18, "end": 35.6}, {"w": "of", "start": 35.6, "end": 35.72}, {"w": "my", "start": 35.72, "end": 35.94}, {"w": "app.", "start": 35.94, "end": 36.05}]}, {"text": "Your agent picks one of 44 diagram types, tells you its plan, and writes a single HTML file.", "start": 36.6, "end": 42.2, "words": [{"w": "Your", "start": 36.6, "end": 36.82}, {"w": "agent", "start": 36.82, "end": 37.09}, {"w": "picks", "start": 37.09, "end": 37.38}, {"w": "one", "start": 37.38, "end": 37.72}, {"w": "of", "start": 37.72, "end": 38.04}, {"w": "44", "start": 38.04, "end": 38.22}, {"w": "diagram", "start": 38.22, "end": 38.62}, {"w": "types,", "start": 38.62, "end": 39.11}, {"w": "tells", "start": 39.32, "end": 39.56}, {"w": "you", "start": 39.56, "end": 39.68}, {"w": "its", "start": 39.68, "end": 39.82}, {"w": "plan,", "start": 39.82, "end": 40.17}, {"w": "and", "start": 40.44, "end": 40.56}, {"w": "writes", "start": 40.56, "end": 40.8}, {"w": "a", "start": 40.8, "end": 40.96}, {"w": "single", "start": 40.96, "end": 41.3}, {"w": "HTML", "start": 41.48, "end": 41.96}, {"w": "file.", "start": 41.96, "end": 42.2}]}, {"text": "No build step, no JavaScript. One file that opens anywhere.", "start": 43.15, "end": 47.17, "words": [{"w": "No", "start": 43.15, "end": 43.4}, {"w": "build", "start": 43.4, "end": 43.66}, {"w": "step,", "start": 43.66, "end": 43.88}, {"w": "no", "start": 44.21, "end": 44.48}, {"w": "JavaScript.", "start": 44.48, "end": 44.94}, {"w": "One", "start": 45.64, "end": 45.88}, {"w": "file", "start": 45.88, "end": 46.2}, {"w": "that", "start": 46.2, "end": 46.34}, {"w": "opens", "start": 46.34, "end": 46.8}, {"w": "anywhere.", "start": 46.8, "end": 47.17}]}, {"text": "Now, the trick: it's not what it adds. It's what it refuses to add.", "start": 47.73, "end": 52.1, "words": [{"w": "Now,", "start": 47.73, "end": 47.99}, {"w": "the", "start": 48.18, "end": 48.32}, {"w": "trick:", "start": 48.32, "end": 48.57}, {"w": "it's", "start": 49.13, "end": 49.34}, {"w": "not", "start": 49.34, "end": 49.5}, {"w": "what", "start": 49.5, "end": 49.64}, {"w": "it", "start": 49.64, "end": 49.69}, {"w": "adds.", "start": 49.9, "end": 50.08}, {"w": "It's", "start": 50.66, "end": 50.84}, {"w": "what", "start": 50.84, "end": 51.0}, {"w": "it", "start": 51.0, "end": 51.08}, {"w": "refuses", "start": 51.08, "end": 51.78}, {"w": "to", "start": 51.78, "end": 51.88}, {"w": "add.", "start": 51.88, "end": 52.1}]}, {"text": "One accent colour, saved for the one thing that matters. Hairline borders. Zero shadows. Everything snapped to a 4-pixel grid.", "start": 52.82, "end": 61.4, "words": [{"w": "One", "start": 52.82, "end": 53.04}, {"w": "accent", "start": 53.04, "end": 53.41}, {"w": "colour,", "start": 53.41, "end": 53.57}, {"w": "saved", "start": 54.02, "end": 54.46}, {"w": "for", "start": 54.46, "end": 54.6}, {"w": "the", "start": 54.6, "end": 54.9}, {"w": "one", "start": 54.9, "end": 55.08}, {"w": "thing", "start": 55.08, "end": 55.28}, {"w": "that", "start": 55.28, "end": 55.44}, {"w": "matters.", "start": 55.44, "end": 55.7}, {"w": "Hairline", "start": 56.35, "end": 56.9}, {"w": "borders.", "start": 56.9, "end": 57.21}, {"w": "Zero", "start": 57.9, "end": 58.34}, {"w": "shadows.", "start": 58.34, "end": 58.63}, {"w": "Everything", "start": 59.25, "end": 59.76}, {"w": "snapped", "start": 59.76, "end": 60.16}, {"w": "to", "start": 60.16, "end": 60.53}, {"w": "a", "start": 60.53, "end": 60.76}, {"w": "4-pixel", "start": 60.76, "end": 61.14}, {"w": "grid.", "start": 61.14, "end": 61.4}]}, {"text": "As its own rulebook says: the highest-quality move is usually deletion.", "start": 61.93, "end": 66.19, "words": [{"w": "As", "start": 61.93, "end": 62.1}, {"w": "its", "start": 62.1, "end": 62.28}, {"w": "own", "start": 62.28, "end": 62.46}, {"w": "rulebook", "start": 62.46, "end": 62.86}, {"w": "says:", "start": 62.86, "end": 63.22}, {"w": "the", "start": 63.58, "end": 63.76}, {"w": "highest-quality", "start": 63.76, "end": 64.54}, {"w": "move", "start": 64.54, "end": 64.83}, {"w": "is", "start": 65.0, "end": 65.36}, {"w": "usually", "start": 65.36, "end": 65.76}, {"w": "deletion.", "start": 65.76, "end": 66.19}]}, {"text": "And it draws far more than boxes: flowcharts, timelines, Sankeys, Wardley maps, even exploded 3D views of a whole stack.", "start": 66.76, "end": 75.33, "words": [{"w": "And", "start": 66.76, "end": 66.9}, {"w": "it", "start": 66.9, "end": 67.0}, {"w": "draws", "start": 67.0, "end": 67.44}, {"w": "far", "start": 67.44, "end": 67.72}, {"w": "more", "start": 67.72, "end": 67.92}, {"w": "than", "start": 67.92, "end": 68.1}, {"w": "boxes:", "start": 68.1, "end": 68.43}, {"w": "flowcharts,", "start": 69.23, "end": 69.95}, {"w": "timelines,", "start": 70.07, "end": 70.84}, {"w": "Sankeys,", "start": 70.93, "end": 71.61}, {"w": "Wardley", "start": 71.88, "end": 72.32}, {"w": "maps,", "start": 72.32, "end": 72.66}, {"w": "even", "start": 72.95, "end": 73.2}, {"w": "exploded", "start": 73.2, "end": 73.76}, {"w": "3D", "start": 74.06, "end": 74.26}, {"w": "views", "start": 74.26, "end": 74.52}, {"w": "of", "start": 74.52, "end": 74.64}, {"w": "a", "start": 74.64, "end": 74.72}, {"w": "whole", "start": 74.72, "end": 75.0}, {"w": "stack.", "start": 75.0, "end": 75.33}]}, {"text": "Got an old diagram? Hand it a draw.io, Mermaid or Excalidraw file, and it redraws it, with a receipt of what it merged or dropped.", "start": 75.9, "end": 84.1, "words": [{"w": "Got", "start": 75.9, "end": 76.14}, {"w": "an", "start": 76.14, "end": 76.22}, {"w": "old", "start": 76.22, "end": 76.38}, {"w": "diagram?", "start": 76.38, "end": 76.9}, {"w": "Hand", "start": 77.27, "end": 77.52}, {"w": "it", "start": 77.52, "end": 77.64}, {"w": "a", "start": 77.64, "end": 77.76}, {"w": "draw.io,", "start": 77.76, "end": 78.73}, {"w": "Mermaid", "start": 78.87, "end": 79.48}, {"w": "or", "start": 79.48, "end": 79.7}, {"w": "Excalidraw", "start": 79.7, "end": 80.45}, {"w": "file,", "start": 80.45, "end": 80.75}, {"w": "and", "start": 81.0, "end": 81.16}, {"w": "it", "start": 81.16, "end": 81.28}, {"w": "redraws", "start": 81.28, "end": 81.78}, {"w": "it,", "start": 81.78, "end": 81.86}, {"w": "with", "start": 82.2, "end": 82.38}, {"w": "a", "start": 82.38, "end": 82.44}, {"w": "receipt", "start": 82.44, "end": 82.85}, {"w": "of", "start": 82.85, "end": 83.02}, {"w": "what", "start": 83.02, "end": 83.16}, {"w": "it", "start": 83.16, "end": 83.3}, {"w": "merged", "start": 83.3, "end": 83.65}, {"w": "or", "start": 83.65, "end": 83.82}, {"w": "dropped.", "start": 83.82, "end": 84.1}]}, {"text": "Want your company's look? Give it your website, and it pulls your colours and fonts, and checks the text stays readable.", "start": 84.64, "end": 90.51, "words": [{"w": "Want", "start": 84.64, "end": 84.88}, {"w": "your", "start": 84.88, "end": 85.02}, {"w": "company's", "start": 85.02, "end": 85.48}, {"w": "look?", "start": 85.48, "end": 85.64}, {"w": "Give", "start": 86.15, "end": 86.32}, {"w": "it", "start": 86.32, "end": 86.4}, {"w": "your", "start": 86.4, "end": 86.54}, {"w": "website,", "start": 86.54, "end": 86.91}, {"w": "and", "start": 87.06, "end": 87.2}, {"w": "it", "start": 87.2, "end": 87.31}, {"w": "pulls", "start": 87.31, "end": 87.58}, {"w": "your", "start": 87.58, "end": 87.71}, {"w": "colours", "start": 87.71, "end": 88.12}, {"w": "and", "start": 88.12, "end": 88.28}, {"w": "fonts,", "start": 88.28, "end": 88.65}, {"w": "and", "start": 88.94, "end": 89.12}, {"w": "checks", "start": 89.12, "end": 89.38}, {"w": "the", "start": 89.38, "end": 89.5}, {"w": "text", "start": 89.5, "end": 89.92}, {"w": "stays", "start": 89.92, "end": 90.22}, {"w": "readable.", "start": 90.22, "end": 90.51}]}, {"text": "It works in Claude Code, Codex, Copilot, Cursor and more, and exports SVG or PNG for slides and docs.", "start": 91.03, "end": 98.51, "words": [{"w": "It", "start": 91.03, "end": 91.18}, {"w": "works", "start": 91.18, "end": 91.46}, {"w": "in", "start": 91.46, "end": 91.57}, {"w": "Claude", "start": 91.57, "end": 91.91}, {"w": "Code,", "start": 91.91, "end": 92.29}, {"w": "Codex,", "start": 92.42, "end": 92.8}, {"w": "Copilot,", "start": 93.15, "end": 93.75}, {"w": "Cursor", "start": 93.84, "end": 94.36}, {"w": "and", "start": 94.36, "end": 94.5}, {"w": "more,", "start": 94.5, "end": 94.76}, {"w": "and", "start": 95.25, "end": 95.5}, {"w": "exports", "start": 95.5, "end": 95.84}, {"w": "SVG", "start": 96.02, "end": 96.56}, {"w": "or", "start": 96.56, "end": 96.8}, {"w": "PNG", "start": 96.8, "end": 97.43}, {"w": "for", "start": 97.43, "end": 97.62}, {"w": "slides", "start": 97.62, "end": 98.0}, {"w": "and", "start": 98.0, "end": 98.1}, {"w": "docs.", "start": 98.1, "end": 98.51}]}, {"text": "The catch: it's only as good as the model running it, the same prompt can lay out differently, and you get a picture, not an editable canvas.", "start": 98.98, "end": 107.02, "words": [{"w": "The", "start": 98.98, "end": 99.1}, {"w": "catch:", "start": 99.1, "end": 99.53}, {"w": "it's", "start": 99.95, "end": 100.19}, {"w": "only", "start": 100.19, "end": 100.48}, {"w": "as", "start": 100.48, "end": 100.58}, {"w": "good", "start": 100.58, "end": 100.78}, {"w": "as", "start": 100.78, "end": 100.88}, {"w": "the", "start": 100.88, "end": 101.04}, {"w": "model", "start": 101.04, "end": 101.38}, {"w": "running", "start": 101.38, "end": 101.64}, {"w": "it,", "start": 101.64, "end": 102.27}, {"w": "the", "start": 102.27, "end": 102.4}, {"w": "same", "start": 102.4, "end": 102.64}, {"w": "prompt", "start": 102.64, "end": 103.04}, {"w": "can", "start": 103.04, "end": 103.22}, {"w": "lay", "start": 103.22, "end": 103.4}, {"w": "out", "start": 103.4, "end": 103.54}, {"w": "differently,", "start": 103.54, "end": 103.9}, {"w": "and", "start": 104.38, "end": 104.62}, {"w": "you", "start": 104.62, "end": 104.74}, {"w": "get", "start": 104.74, "end": 104.86}, {"w": "a", "start": 104.86, "end": 104.95}, {"w": "picture,", "start": 104.95, "end": 105.34}, {"w": "not", "start": 105.53, "end": 105.84}, {"w": "an", "start": 105.84, "end": 106.01}, {"w": "editable", "start": 106.01, "end": 106.44}, {"w": "canvas.", "start": 106.44, "end": 107.02}]}, {"text": "If your diagrams live in Git and change every week, stick with Mermaid.", "start": 107.44, "end": 111.06, "words": [{"w": "If", "start": 107.44, "end": 107.54}, {"w": "your", "start": 107.54, "end": 107.74}, {"w": "diagrams", "start": 107.74, "end": 108.28}, {"w": "live", "start": 108.28, "end": 108.46}, {"w": "in", "start": 108.46, "end": 108.64}, {"w": "Git", "start": 108.64, "end": 108.95}, {"w": "and", "start": 109.06, "end": 109.26}, {"w": "change", "start": 109.26, "end": 109.56}, {"w": "every", "start": 109.56, "end": 109.8}, {"w": "week,", "start": 109.8, "end": 109.96}, {"w": "stick", "start": 110.37, "end": 110.63}, {"w": "with", "start": 110.63, "end": 110.8}, {"w": "Mermaid.", "start": 110.8, "end": 111.06}]}, {"text": "But for the one diagram that has to convince someone, this is it.", "start": 111.62, "end": 115.07, "words": [{"w": "But", "start": 111.62, "end": 111.8}, {"w": "for", "start": 111.8, "end": 111.94}, {"w": "the", "start": 111.94, "end": 112.18}, {"w": "one", "start": 112.18, "end": 112.36}, {"w": "diagram", "start": 112.36, "end": 112.82}, {"w": "that", "start": 112.82, "end": 113.12}, {"w": "has", "start": 113.12, "end": 113.38}, {"w": "to", "start": 113.38, "end": 113.49}, {"w": "convince", "start": 113.49, "end": 113.9}, {"w": "someone,", "start": 113.9, "end": 114.27}, {"w": "this", "start": 114.47, "end": 114.84}, {"w": "is", "start": 114.84, "end": 115.0}, {"w": "it.", "start": 115.0, "end": 115.07}]}, {"text": "One command, and your next diagram looks like you hired a designer.", "start": 115.76, "end": 119.02, "words": [{"w": "One", "start": 115.76, "end": 115.94}, {"w": "command,", "start": 115.94, "end": 116.28}, {"w": "and", "start": 116.68, "end": 116.78}, {"w": "your", "start": 116.78, "end": 116.98}, {"w": "next", "start": 116.98, "end": 117.2}, {"w": "diagram", "start": 117.2, "end": 117.68}, {"w": "looks", "start": 117.68, "end": 117.84}, {"w": "like", "start": 117.84, "end": 117.98}, {"w": "you", "start": 117.98, "end": 118.16}, {"w": "hired", "start": 118.16, "end": 118.44}, {"w": "a", "start": 118.44, "end": 118.52}, {"w": "designer.", "start": 118.52, "end": 119.02}]}, {"text": "That's today's tool. Subscribe, there's a new one every day.", "start": 119.53, "end": 122.97, "words": [{"w": "That's", "start": 119.53, "end": 119.84}, {"w": "today's", "start": 119.84, "end": 120.18}, {"w": "tool.", "start": 120.18, "end": 120.48}, {"w": "Subscribe,", "start": 120.87, "end": 121.42}, {"w": "there's", "start": 121.72, "end": 121.96}, {"w": "a", "start": 121.96, "end": 122.06}, {"w": "new", "start": 122.06, "end": 122.26}, {"w": "one", "start": 122.26, "end": 122.45}, {"w": "every", "start": 122.45, "end": 122.8}, {"w": "day.", "start": 122.8, "end